# Native Settings at 320x480 (profile p320; study portrait-320, PR-B): the root, the Screen section and the DarkTime
# choice list. Golden at 320x480 only.
title p320 settings
sizes 320x480
profile p320
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 1
keyboards 0
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
config dark_time 60
home
launch Settings
shot p320_settings_root
key ENTER
shot p320_settings_screen
key DOWN
key ENTER
shot p320_settings_darktime
